  "source": "XINJE INVC0620240409EN1.3.3, function tables PDF pp.42–80 and Modbus pp.190–195. P9-03 factory code 1 selects 8E1, despite the appendix overview saying no parity. No addresses are invented for local-only P8/A4 or U4. Reviewed dependent scales, units, bounds and hex masks are supported. PF layout follows functional version P8-16, not P8-15; ambiguous revision encoding blocks writes. Unconfirmed digit packing stays read-only. Only parameter FC06 EEPROM writes are used; no start, stop, speed-reference or reset commands are exposed."
